The test data in test/fixtures comes from:
- the test suite of vscode-textmate 9.2.0 (test/fixtures/vscode-textmate, same
  copyright and license, see test/fixtures/vscode-textmate/LICENSE.md),
  including the grammars and themes it bundles (see
  test/fixtures/vscode-textmate/themes/syntaxes and the theme files);
- the grammars of tm-grammars 1.31.15, as bundled by shiki 3.23
  (test/fixtures/grammars, see test/fixtures/grammars/NOTICE.md);
- Loreline (test/fixtures/loreline), Copyright (c) 2025 Jérémy Faivre, MIT
  (see test/fixtures/loreline/LICENSE);
- the samples listed in test/fixtures/samples/NOTICE.md, each under its own
  license.

